note right of ThermodynamicStructure
  Enforces First & Second Laws:
  - dU/dt = Q_in - W_out + sum(m_in * h_in) - sum(m_out * h_out)
  - dS/dt = Q/T + sum(m_in * s_in) - sum(m_out * s_out) + S_gen
  - S_gen >= 0 (Second Law Validation)
  - Gouy-Stodola: Exergy Destruction = T_0 * S_gen
